  "description": "GameFrameX.Capability.Online.Competition,GFX Online 竞技能力包(冻结面:不删除、不演进):赛季/锦标赛承载(InMemory 默认存储,懒默认描述符,族/宿主覆盖恒胜出)+ 自装配模块(OnlineCompetitionCapabilityModule,必选依赖 online-leaderboard);榜单能力已拆至 GameFrameX.Capability.Online.Leaderboard 独立包,LiveOps 运营面移交 Admin 仓. Frozen competition capability package for the GFX Online family: seasons and tournaments with in-memory default stores and the self-assembling module requiring online-leaderboard; leaderboards moved to the dedicated leaderboard package and LiveOps handed over to the admin console. Documentation: https://gameframex.doc.alianblank.com",
